@host = http://localhost:8080
@admin_email = admin@example.com
@admin_password = change-me

### Admin login — captures the JWT as `login`
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{admin_email}}",
  "password": "{{admin_password}}"
}

### Whoami — current user (requires Bearer JWT)
# @ref login
GET {{host}}/api/auth/whoami
Authorization: Bearer {{login.token}}

### Refresh admin session (rotate the JWT)
# @ref login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/admin/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{login.token}}
